  "goodToKnow": "Die Lichtung is a clearing in a forest, where light reaches the ground. It comes from licht in its sense of sparse or open (lichter Wald), not only bright; the verb lichten means to thin out (Die Reihen lichten sich) or to weigh anchor (den Anker lichten). Clearings feature in many fairy tales. Plural: die Lichtungen."
